#: ../../usage/retrieve_lookup.rst:4
msgid "Lookup Files"
msgstr "查找文件"

#: ../../usage/retrieve_lookup.rst:6
msgid "The steps to follow to :index:`lookup files` are:"
msgstr ":index:`查找文件`的步骤如下："

#: ../../usage/retrieve_lookup.rst:9
msgid "Step 1"
msgstr "步骤 1"

#: ../../usage/retrieve_lookup.rst:11
msgid "Add your files using :menuselection:`\"Files --> Add Files...\"` or :menuselection:`\"Files --> Add Folder...\"`."
msgstr ""
"使用 :menuselection:`\"Files --> Add Files...\"` 或 "
":menuselection:`\"Files --> Add Folder...\"` 添加您的文件。"

#: ../../usage/retrieve_lookup.rst:13
msgid "For ease of use it is recommended to use the internal File Browser to manage file system interactions. This is enabled from :menuselection:`\"View --> File Browser\"`."
msgstr ""
"为了方便使用，建议使用内部文件浏览器来管理文件系统交互。这可以通过 "
":menuselection:`\"View --> File Browser\"` 来启用。"

#: ../../usage/retrieve_lookup.rst:29
msgid "Step 2"
msgstr "步骤 2"

#: ../../usage/retrieve_lookup.rst:31
msgid "Drag the selected directory or files to the \"Unclustered Files\" folder, and wait for Picard to process the files - the names will turn from grey to black."
msgstr ""
"将选定的目录或文件拖到 \"未聚类文件\" 文件夹中，并等待 Picard 处理文件——文件"
"名将从灰色变为黑色。"

#: ../../usage/retrieve_lookup.rst:47
msgid "Step 3"
msgstr "步骤 3"

#: ../../usage/retrieve_lookup.rst:49
msgid "Use :menuselection:`\"Tools --> Cluster\"` to group the files into album :index:`clusters <pair: cluster; lookup>`."
msgstr ""
"使用 :menuselection:`\"Tools --> Cluster\"` 将文件分组到专辑 :index:`聚类 "
"<pair: cluster; lookup>`。"

#: ../../usage/retrieve_lookup.rst:65
msgid "Step 4"
msgstr "步骤 4"

#: ../../usage/retrieve_lookup.rst:67
msgid "Select a clustered album and use :menuselection:`\"Tools --> Lookup\"` to lookup the cluster. Depending on your previous metadata, the album will show up in the right-hand pane."
msgstr ""
"选择一个聚类的专辑并使用 :menuselection:`\"Tools --> Lookup\"` 来查找聚类。根"
"据您之前的元数据，专辑将显示在右侧面板中。"

#: ../../usage/retrieve_lookup.rst:69
msgid "A music symbol in front of a track number in the right-hand pane indicates that there has been no file assigned to the track."
msgstr "在右侧窗格中的音轨号前有一个音乐符号，表示该音轨没有分配文件。"

#: ../../usage/retrieve_lookup.rst:84
msgid "If you're not sure that the album retrieved is correct, you can use :menuselection:`\"Tools --> Show other album versions...\"` to open a window displaying all releases matched. From this window, you can select a different matching version to use, or refine the search criteria and perform a new search."
msgstr ""
"如果您不确定检索到的专辑是否正确，您可以使用 :menuselection:`\"Tools --> "
"Show other album versions...\"` 打开一个显示所有匹配发行品的窗口。从该窗口，"
"您可以选择使用不同的匹配版本，或细化搜索条件并执行新的搜索。"

#: ../../usage/retrieve_lookup.rst:99
msgid "If no album was retrieved, or if the album retrieved was incorrect, you may have to try a different method such as scanning the files or a manual lookup."
msgstr ""
"如果没有检索到专辑，或者检索到的专辑不正确，您可能需要尝试不同的方法，例如扫"
"描文件或手动查找。"
